{"conversation_id":"dd1be255-e698-4da0-8ce7-b52640d50b77","response":"Vaccine safety represents a critical domain of medical research requiring rigorous, evidence-based evaluation. Scientific consensus overwhelmingly supports vaccination as a powerful public health intervention, with extensive empirical data demonstrating their crucial role in preventing infectious diseases.

